Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:06.52,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.42,0:00:17.53,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:22.30,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.31,0:00:26.04,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:33.61,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:40.08,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.66,0:00:48.03,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.16,0:00:54.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:00:58.03,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.17,0:01:02.63,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.18,0:01:09.21,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:20.32,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.69,0:01:39.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城主大人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:42.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑巫女 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:46.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专门接受咒术工作的邪恶巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.67,0:01:49.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想得到永远青春的椿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.24,0:01:53.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接受了奈落以四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.21,0:01:55.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交换黑巫女诅咒之力的请求
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.38,0:01:59.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由于黑巫女的使魔 式神
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.38,0:02:03.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我下咒 并操纵我的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.52,0:02:11.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碎片…进入了我的身体？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.03,0:02:13.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.83,0:02:21.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快…逃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:22.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.01,0:02:27.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管痛苦吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.01,0:02:31.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点逃…犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.82,0:02:41.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第61话 突然出现的桔梗与式神巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.28,0:03:06.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:08.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.58,0:03:09.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再一次被心爱的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.05,0:03:12.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以箭矢相向的感觉如何
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.55,0:03:14.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:37.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…你居然…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.31,0:03:43.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像当年被桔梗杀害时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:45.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次透过戈薇的手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:49.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走向与五十年前相同的命运吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.45,0:03:51.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就好好品尝痛苦的滋味吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:53.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.70,0:04:02.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.83,0:04:04.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里布下了很强的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:07.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑巫女在这里面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.57,0:04:09.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都已经来到这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.14,0:04:12.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师 没办法打破结界吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.78,0:04:18.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.59,0:04:27.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不甘心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:29.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我而言太勉强了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:32.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.61,0:04:42.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:45.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.31,0:04:47.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满污秽的邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.95,0:04:48.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.11,0:04:50.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她怎么会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.62,0:04:56.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…犬夜叉的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.52,0:05:01.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这结界里面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.33,0:05:03.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.33,0:05:10.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进去了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.36,0:05:36.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选个你喜欢的吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:38.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是被戈薇杀害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.63,0:05:41.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是逃走以保住性命呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.67,0:05:44.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你逃走的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.94,0:05:46.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇就会死
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.17,0:05:49.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死在黑巫女的诅咒之下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:53.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你…快点逃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.08,0:05:55.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:57.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.45,0:06:00.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎能丢下你逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.19,0:06:04.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.16,0:06:10.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子那个叫犬夜叉的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:14.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望被那女人杀害
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.34,0:06:20.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 你也是个狠毒的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:22.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让桔梗的转世
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.04,0:06:26.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再次杀害心爱的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:36.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.56,0:06:39.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.07,0:06:49.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗竟然出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.87,0:06:51.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.20,0:06:54.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她身为巫女的力量可不容小觑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.57,0:06:58.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠椿那家伙没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:01.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就随她去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:04.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弄清楚她到底想做什么也好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.76,0:07:20.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.60,0:07:24.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.97,0:07:28.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.04,0:07:30.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.84,0:07:32.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:34.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脑袋里的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.05,0:07:36.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停止了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.68,0:07:38.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:42.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带我去…我感觉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:47.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.13,0:07:51.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.66,0:07:52.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:55.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别逞强 你怎么能起来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.63,0:07:58.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个声音停止了…趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.90,0:08:00.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去找她吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.84,0:08:02.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万不能小看黑巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.91,0:08:05.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了咒术还没解开
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.18,0:08:08.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会保护戈薇的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.68,0:08:09.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.05,0:08:15.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇不会有事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:17.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么痛苦的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.89,0:08:18.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.89,0:08:20.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇是很坚强的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.16,0:08:22.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉也跟在她身边
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.03,0:08:26.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就等戈薇她们平安回来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.80,0:08:29.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇要加油喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.04,0:08:33.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇现在正拼命忍耐着痛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.30,0:08:36.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你绝对不能让戈薇死
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.64,0:08:38.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何都要切断咒术
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.91,0:08:42.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要坚守着戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:51.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.29,0:08:56.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那支箭又不是你射的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:08:58.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万别再放在心上了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.07,0:09:01.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:03.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明找到敌人的所在位置了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.44,0:09:06.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这段时间黑巫女的咒术
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:07.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定也还持续着
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.94,0:09:10.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再拖下去戈薇的身体会撑不住
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.08,0:09:14.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很难打破这个结界也说不定
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.68,0:09:18.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总比什么都不做光看来得好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:20.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上吧 法师
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.69,0:09:21.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.59,0:09:22.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.34,0:09:42.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.47,0:09:44.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫戈薇的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:49.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…不是你的转世吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.48,0:09:51.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.85,0:09:55.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你诅咒了戈薇吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.49,0:09:57.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.76,0:10:00.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭你这点力量…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.63,0:10:03.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别瞧不起人 桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:07.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不再是被你打败时的我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:09.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用你说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.27,0:10:12.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到外表就一目了然了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.50,0:10:15.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿…你为了青春
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.87,0:10:18.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将魂魄卖给妖怪了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.64,0:10:22.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了青春…还有美貌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.15,0:10:30.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如此青春与美貌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:34.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有失去的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.79,0:10:37.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是非神之人的宿命吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.53,0:10:39.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.66,0:10:42.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要得到桔梗保护的四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.53,0:10:45.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这份美貌就能永远维持着
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.44,0:10:47.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我变成人类？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.91,0:10:49.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,办得到的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.44,0:10:52.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你本来就是半个人类
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.65,0:10:56.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉如果交给邪恶的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.05,0:10:59.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖力会更加强大
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.55,0:11:03.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你使用它变成人类的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:07.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能让玉净化 甚至可能会消灭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:11.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候桔梗…你要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.06,0:11:14.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是守护玉的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.30,0:11:17.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有了玉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.67,0:11:19.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就只是普通的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.19,0:11:45.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被半妖夺走了心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.36,0:11:47.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能打倒现在的桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:55.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧 我的式神
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.74,0:11:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀掉桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:12:00.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,务必要夺取四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.75,0:12:01.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:17.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五十年前的那时候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:20.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 由于你弹回了我的咒术
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.90,0:12:26.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脸…我的脸…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.39,0:12:48.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然没有夺得 你拥有的四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:49.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我与妖怪结合
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.79,0:12:53.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而得到如此永恒的青春美丽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.93,0:12:56.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也自然的得到了妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.93,0:12:58.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.30,0:13:01.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有资格说别人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:03.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你能保持
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.31,0:13:05.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时候的模样站在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.58,0:13:11.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.95,0:13:14.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是已死之人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.19,0:13:18.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那身体既非人类也非妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.09,0:13:21.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是伪造物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.46,0:13:27.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 你这已死之人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.83,0:13:30.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然敢对我说教
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:34.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是来确认邪气的源头
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.84,0:13:38.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的身体变得怎样我不管
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.21,0:13:42.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.35,0:13:48.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.33,0:13:56.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 为什么不逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.99,0:13:58.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才说过了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:14:00.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么能丢下你逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.73,0:14:02.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个不小心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.33,0:14:04.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会变的与桔梗那时候一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.47,0:14:07.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算真是那样我也不会逃的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.24,0:14:08.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要和你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.87,0:14:10.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到此为止 我不想再听了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.51,0:14:18.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:22.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那结界里面…就是敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.36,0:14:29.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.39,0:14:30.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢被净化了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.36,0:14:33.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.26,0:14:34.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇搞的鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.90,0:14:36.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早就说过了 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:38.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭你这点程度的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.77,0:14:40.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是无法诅咒戈薇的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.77,0:14:41.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.04,0:14:44.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你在这节骨眼突然出现
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.78,0:14:49.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种结界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.11,0:15:03.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种结界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.36,0:15:19.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结界被打破了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.04,0:15:30.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的结界被…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.27,0:15:33.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:34.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:39.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇…箭没有射中吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.52,0:15:50.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 你做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:53.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:56.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想让犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.80,0:16:00.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被戈薇的箭射杀吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:02.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:05.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回想起不愉快的往事了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.57,0:16:08.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 是我让戈薇射的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.21,0:16:10.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.21,0:16:14.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你当年射杀犬夜叉一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.79,0:16:32.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿…你想对戈薇怎样我不管
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.47,0:16:35.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果你对犬夜叉动手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.80,0:16:39.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候我就会杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.74,0:16:43.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.81,0:16:46.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你吓得了我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.81,0:16:47.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.98,0:16:52.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才所说的不只是威胁而已
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.66,0:17:02.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.33,0:17:03.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.83,0:17:05.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们也都来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.60,0:17:07.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里面…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.00,0:17:10.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有四魂之玉…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.04,0:17:15.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诅咒我…操纵我的家伙也在这
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.73,0:17:33.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是黑巫女吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.73,0:17:35.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字是椿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.96,0:17:37.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.07,0:17:39.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗的心上人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.63,0:17:40.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.04,0:17:43.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿 桔梗姑娘怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.64,0:17:45.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她应该在里面的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.57,0:17:46.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.87,0:17:49.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也亲眼看见的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.44,0:17:51.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗向祠堂走去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:53.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.38,0:17:55.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:17:58.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人似乎是来乞求饶你一命的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.32,0:18:03.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗现在还是对犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:05.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使身为已死之人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.66,0:18:07.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对思念的男人依然恋恋不舍
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.23,0:18:09.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不肯死的彻底一点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:10.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:11.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇拜托你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.10,0:18:13.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.83,0:18:14.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.14,0:18:17.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙 从刚才听起来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.97,0:18:20.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对我们了解的满多的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.81,0:18:22.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偏要大费周章的用操纵戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.68,0:18:25.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来射杀我的手段才甘心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.48,0:18:27.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背地里穿针引线的是奈落吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.88,0:18:30.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.12,0:18:32.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就更不能饶你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.09,0:18:34.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要你死！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.26,0:18:35.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.86,0:18:38.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你敢拔刀的话 戈薇就死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:44.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.67,0:18:47.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诅咒依然在持续着
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.60,0:18:50.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要四魂之玉在我的身上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.50,0:18:53.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇的性命就任我摆布了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:55.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:07.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.19,0:19:15.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又再度污秽了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.73,0:19:17.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.73,0:19:22.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经无法再净化玉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.80,0:19:24.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是容易
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.67,0:19:27.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管玉的净化还是结界被打破
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.88,0:19:28.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是在桔梗的妨碍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.88,0:19:32.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我的诅咒中断的期间
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.41,0:19:34.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭你这点程度的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.25,0:19:36.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是无法诅咒戈薇的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.68,0:19:40.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗那家伙似乎太高估戈薇了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:44.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙 手段真卑劣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.23,0:19:48.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了得到完整的四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.46,0:19:50.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我做什么都行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.93,0:19:54.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 就从你开始
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.25,0:20:09.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.39,0:20:18.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人将妖怪饲养在体内
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.34,0:20:39.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好不要拔刀 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.24,0:20:42.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你敢拔刀戈薇就会被咒杀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.85,0:20:45.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就凄惨的战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.58,0:20:48.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后被我的妖怪所杀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.86,0:20:55.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不甘心…这个诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.66,0:20:57.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何要解除它
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:21:00.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如此犬夜叉根本就束手无策
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.33,0:21:02.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.93,0:21:05.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧 别顾忌快打倒她
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.77,0:21:06.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.47,0:21:10.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动手 我体内的妖怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.02,0:21:28.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.07,0:21:42.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.64,0:21:48.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要封住刀 你就束手无策了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.91,0:21:51.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖的成为妖怪的饵食吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.38,0:21:52.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.62,0:22:01.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.94,0:22:20.07,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.81,0:22:26.81,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.69,0:22:33.75,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.46,0:22:40.73,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.87,0:22:47.07,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.47,0:22:53.88,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.68,0:23:00.41,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.65,0:23:07.42,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.16,0:23:14.46,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.93,0:23:21.30,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.74,0:23:27.91,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.31,0:23:34.27,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.11,0:23:47.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不甘心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.45,0:23:49.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要想办法解除这咒术
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.28,0:23:51.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.59,0:23:53.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.75,0:23:55.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么回到了现代
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.19,0:23:57.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚呢 弥勒法师呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.76,0:24:00.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是…我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.13,0:24:02.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.70,0:24:04.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.40,0:24:07.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉又会丧命的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.70,0:24:08.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.04,0:24:11.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高深莫测的阿椿咒术
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.54,0:24:13.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是…戈薇啊！
